    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b0e421976b9844b9aaa827d7dce7e344",
      "statement": "Each node tests the store's conditional-write contract once at startup (two of four probe writes must fail) and stops on a broken store; CELLD_STORAGE_PROBE=0 disables the test, and celld reserves the probe/, cells/, nodes/, node-cells/, fleet/, deploy/, deploy-blobs/, wake/, and telemetry/ key prefixes in the bucket.",
